          <rect x="229" y="212" width="70" height="5" rx="2" fill="#E8E2D8"/>
          <rect x="229" y="223" width="46" height="5" rx="2" fill="#2F6B4E"/>
          <rect x="229" y="234" width="102" height="17" rx="2" fill="#F3EFE7"/>
          <rect x="235" y="243" width="6" height="8" fill="#2F6B4E"/>
          <rect x="245" y="238" width="6" height="13" fill="#2F6B4E"/>
          <rect x="255" y="240" width="6" height="11" fill="#2F6B4E"/>
          <rect x="265" y="235" width="6" height="16" fill="#2F6B4E"/>
          <rect x="275" y="239" width="6" height="12" fill="#2F6B4E"/>
          <path d="M 195 262 L 365 262 L 372 273 Q 373 278 366 278 L 194 278 Q 187 278 188 273 Z" fill="#2A2521"/>
          <rect x="256" y="266" width="48" height="4" rx="2" fill="#4A443C"/>
          <rect x="232" y="298" width="96" height="18" rx="9" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#E8E2D8"/>
          <text x="280" y="310" text-anchor="middle" class="sans" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#1A1714">Laptop</text>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="btn-wrap">
      <a href={site.appUrl} class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        TRY NOW
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── H2 Section 2 Divider ──────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="b4s2" aria-labelledby="insights-heading">
    <h2 id="insights-heading">How Real-Time Insights Drive Better Decisions</h2>
    <p>
      Seeing the right number at the right moment changes the decision you make.
      Here is how the live dashboard translates data into competitive advantage.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- ── H2 Section 2 Content ──────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="content-section" aria-label="Benefits of real-time financial insights">
    <div class="container">

      <!-- H3: Spot Trends Before They Become Problems -->
      <div class="feature-block">
        <h3 class="feature-block-heading">Spot Trends Before They Become Problems</h3>
        <p class="feature-block-body">
          Pattern recognition used to require an accountant and a week's wait. With live data,
          unusual spikes in expenses or a dip in collection rates are visible the day they appear —
          giving you time to act, not react.
        </p>
        <ul class="criteria-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Expense Anomaly Detection</strong>
            <p>Automatic flagging when a spending category exceeds its 90-day average by more than 20%.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Revenue Trend Lines</strong>
            <p>Weekly revenue charted against the prior period so you can validate whether growth is holding.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Collection Rate Tracking</strong>
            <p>Invoice-to-payment speed shown as a rolling average — identify slow-paying clients early.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Budget vs. Actual Overlay</strong>
            <p>Compare live spend against your approved budget in every category, updated continuously.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- H3: Stay Tax-Ready Year-Round -->
      <div class="feature-block">
        <h3 class="feature-block-heading">Stay Tax-Ready Year-Round</h3>
        <p class="feature-block-body">
          Tax season stress comes from scrambling to reconstruct months of data.
          With transactions categorised in real time, your GST/HST position, deductible expenses,
          and CRA remittance schedule are always current — not something you figure out in April.
        </p>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li>Automatic GST/HST calculation per transaction</li>
          <li>Deductible expense tagging as you code</li>
          <li>CRA remittance calendar with due-date alerts</li>
          <li>One-click export for your accountant</li>
          <li>Audit trail preserved automatically</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- H3: Collaborate with Your Accountant in Real Time -->
      <div class="feature-block">
        <h3 class="feature-block-heading">Collaborate with Your Accountant in Real Time</h3>
        <p class="feature-block-body">
          Give your accountant or bookkeeper a live window into the same dashboard you see.
          They can review transactions, leave notes, and adjust categorisations without
          any back-and-forth file transfers or outdated exports.
        </p>
        <ul class="criteria-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Shared Live View</strong>
            <p>Invite your accountant with one link — they see real-time data, not a snapshot from last week.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>In-Line Comments</strong>
            <p>Leave notes directly on transactions. Questions get answered in context, not lost in email.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Granular Permissions</strong>
            <p>Control exactly what each collaborator can view or edit — down to individual report categories.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Final CTA Divider ─────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="b4s2" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
    <h2 id="cta-heading">See Your Finances Live — Starting Today</h2>
    <p>
      The new Accountium dashboard is now available on all plans. Log in to activate it and start seeing real-time financial insights from day one.
    </p>
